{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"I found the main defects: customer-order lookup first rejects deleted customers, and its repository path does not apply the customer-id filter at all; the paginated response also discards totals whenever a requested page is empty, while page-count calculation is off. I’m fixing those paths and making the order query filters consistently grouped."}}
